# Required Final Response Format

Sau khi hoan thanh task, bao cao theo format:

## Changes

- Liet ke file da tao/sua/xoa voi loai thay doi.

## Implementation

- Mo ta ngan gon logic / thiet ke chinh da ap dung.
- Reference den rule lien quan neu co (vd: xem flashsale-rollback.mdc).

## Database

- Liet ke migration moi (neu co): V{n}__description.sql, noi dung tom tat.
- Liet ke file docs can sync (theo migration-impact-matrix.mdc).

## API / WS

- Endpoint moi/sua.
- WS event moi/sua (neu co).
- Breaking change (neu co).

## Tests

- Java version: java -version output.
- Command: gradlew compileJava / gradlew test / gradlew build.
- Result: passed/failed + tong so.
- Coverage delta (neu co cong cu do).

## Notes

- Limitation con lai.
- Issue phat hien trong qua trinh (khong sua).
- Tham chieu den docs can sync (theo migration-impact-matrix.mdc).

## Issues

- Neu co loi: liet ke loi cu the + file/line + ly do.

## Quy tac bao cao

- KHONG tuyen bo:
  - "perfect"
  - "100% safe"
  - "0% overselling"
  - "guaranteed"
  - "10/10"
- Phai mo ta chinh xac pham vi da kiem tra, ket qua test va limitation con lai.
- Neu co thay doi docs, ghi ro file nao va ly do.
- Trinh bay ro rang, su dung markdown structure, code block neu can.